# eolib-cpp

Core C++17 library for writing Endless Online applications.

The protocol code is generated from the [eo-protocol](https://github.com/cirras/eo-protocol) XML specification. The
API follows the conventions of [eolib-dotnet](https://ethanmoffat.github.io/eolib-dotnet/) and
[eolib-go](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/ethanmoffat/eolib-go/v3). The source code is available on
[GitHub](https://github.com/ethanmoffat/eolib-cpp).

## Features

Read and write the following EO data structures:

- Client and server packets (eolib::protocol::net::client, eolib::protocol::net::server)
- Endless Map Files (EMF) (eolib::protocol::map)
- Client pub files: items, NPCs, spells and classes (eolib::protocol::pub)
- Server pub files: talk, shops, drops, inns and skill masters (eolib::protocol::pub::server)

Utilities:

- Data reader and writer (eolib::data::EoReader, eolib::data::EoWriter)
- Number and string encoding (eolib::data::NumberEncoder, eolib::data::StringEncoder)
- Data encryption and server verification (eolib::encrypt)
- Packet sequencing (eolib::packet)

## Installation

Add eolib to a CMake project with `FetchContent` using the release source archive, or extract a prebuilt package from
the [releases](https://github.com/ethanmoffat/eolib-cpp/releases) and use `find_package(eolib CONFIG REQUIRED)`.
Either way, link the `eolib::eolib` target:

```cmake
include(FetchContent)
FetchContent_Declare(
    eolib
    URL https://github.com/ethanmoffat/eolib-cpp/releases/download/v@EOLIB_DOCS_VERSION@/eolib-@EOLIB_DOCS_VERSION@-src.tar.gz
    URL_HASH SHA512=<contents of eolib-@EOLIB_DOCS_VERSION@-src.tar.gz.sha512>)
FetchContent_MakeAvailable(eolib)

target_link_libraries(my_app PRIVATE eolib::eolib)
```

## Where to start

- @ref md_getting-started "Getting started" walks through the main parts of the API.
- [Namespaces](namespaces.html) lists every namespace with a short description.
- [Classes](annotated.html) lists every class and struct, including the generated packets.
- The [changelog](https://github.com/ethanmoffat/eolib-cpp/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md) lists the changes in each release.
